Z||000000||GWMORGAN||02-07-2000||05:30 PM||||I own a 86GT, original 4spd, now with 87 5spd. Isuzu tranny. I'm about to replace the slave cylinder. Should I use the original 4spd slave cylinder (which I used up to this point for over 6k miles), or should I use the 5spd. slave cylinder? <BR>The 86 4spd is cast iron, while the 87 5spd is smooth.<BR>Thanks for the info guys. ||||reg||5
Z||000001||fiero56||02-07-2000||08:26 PM||||I'm not sure the correct answer. But if it were me, I would use the slave designated for the tranny. Right now you have a 4-cyl tranny in the car, use the slave for that transmission.||||reg||1
